                "text": "I\u2019m going LIVE today with Thana Hickman, founder of Viola\u2019s House, for a powerful conversation on Black maternal health.\n\nWe\u2019re diving into the challenges Black mamas face, what real solutions look like, and how we fight for justice for Black mamas everywhere. https://t.co/nb9WZV7BX2",
