                "retweet_count": 2945,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "You really have to be a special kind of evil to rip $1 BILLION from school mental health and anti-violence programs\u2014because they dared to be inclusive. Trump isn\u2019t saving kids\u2014he\u2019s sacrificing them to push his hateful agenda. https://t.co/f5htClbghZ",
