                "reply_count": 1265,
                "retweet_count": 714,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I voted NO on their \u201cbig, beautiful\u201d bill because it would strip health care from 14 million Americans\u2014including nearly 130,000 people in my district who rely on Medicaid. And it would rip food from the tables of at least 3 million Americans, including 115,000 folks in my district who rely on SNAP to feed their families.\n\nMy full statement:",
