                "retweet_count": 2166,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump cut staffing at the VA, and now Dallas vets are waiting months for care.\n\nSurgeries are being delayed. Vets are being left without mental health care.\n\nI\u2019ve called for an investigation\u2014because if you claim to support veterans, act like it. https://t.co/zG1NMcHoJ6",
