                "quoted_status_profile_id": null,
                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 765,
                "retweet_count": 374,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Proud to stand with my colleagues in the Mental Health Caucus to say it loud and clear: mental health is health. Period.\n\nToo many have been overlooked, misdiagnosed, or denied the care they deserve. That\u2019s not just a health crisis\u2014it\u2019s a justice issue.\n\nIf we\u2019re serious about equity, we have to be serious about access. That means ensuring everyone\u2014regardless of zip code, income, or background\u2014can get the support and treatment they need to heal and thrive.\n\nThis fight isn\u2019t about privilege. It\u2019s about rights. And we\u2019re not letting up.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
                "text_tagged_users_ids": null,
