                "quoted_status_profile_username": "AP",
                "reply_count": 458,
                "retweet_count": 1141,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Let me get this straight\u2014RFK Jr., who's supposed to be all about \"facts and logic,\" is out here removing members of the CDC\u2019s vaccine advisory committee?!?\n\nY\u2019all, these aren\u2019t political appointees. These are public health experts\u2014people who\u2019ve spent their careers working to keep Americans safe from disease.\n\nThis is not how you govern. This is how you play politics with people\u2019s lives.",
                "text_lang": "en",
                "text_tagged_users": null,
